 tration required for non-members\; members are encouraged to pre-register.
    \nVoluntary donations are welcome to cover the costs of the program. Su
 ggested donation $10 per person.   \n  \npurchase tickets  \n  \nAll are 
 welcome — bring your enthusiasm and your applause!  \n  \nPlease remembe
 r to bring your fob to access the building.\n\n
