SUMMARY:Theater Outing - GIANT 
DESCRIPTION:**Shomrei Theater Outing - *GIANT***  \n  \n**Wednesday\, May 
 13\, Matinee at 2:00pm**  \nMusic Box Theater\, 239 West 45th Street\, New
  York  \nadd to your calendar  \n  \nJoin fellow Shomrei theater lovers fo
 r a powerful performance of John Lithgow as Roald Dahl\, the children's bo
 ok author. The play focuses on a controversial period of Dahl's life and h
 is antisemitic writings and comments.  \n  \nGroup ticket price of $169 
 available for Shomrei members &amp\; friends.   \nA minimum of 10 people
  is needed for this reduced ticket pricing.  \nTickets are in the center m
 ezzanine\, rows G &amp\; H. (Note that there is no elevator.)  \n  \n**RSV
 P and payment must be received by Tuesday\, April 21.**  \n  \nTo RSVP and
  get payment info\, contact  Anita Vogel\, avogel1@weichert.com\n\n
LOCATION:Music Box Theatre\, 239 W 45th St\, New York\, NY 10036\, USA
