SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Par
 t III
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives
  about the First Intifada**  \nA Conversation led by Rabbi Justus Baird  
 \n  \nIn this three-part learning series\, we will explore multiple narrat
 ives of the last century of events in Israel/Palestine\, specifically from
  Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal will not be to de
 bate those narratives nor change our own\, but simply to hear and engage w
 ith them.  \n  \nThe first session in May focused on the establishment of 
 the State of Israel.    \nThe second session in November focused on the B
 alfour Declaration period.  \nThis third session will focus on the First I
 ntifada.  \n  \nPlease register so that Rabbi Justus can share materials w
 ith you before the class.   \n(link to come)  \n  \nParticipants should e
 xpect the learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psych
 ologically.  \n  \nReading in advance of each session will be strongly enc
 ouraged.  \n  \nJoining both sessions is recommended but not required.  \n
   \nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Que
 stions?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746
 -5031\n\n
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\, 
 USA\, Social Hall
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
TRANSP:OPAQUE
