UID:TU2144131246
DTSTAMP:20261029T000314Z
SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Par
 t II
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives
 \, Part II**  \nA Learning Series led by Rabbi Justus Baird    \n  \nA t
 hree-part series exploring dual narratives of events in Israel/Palestine\,
  specifically from Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal
  of the series is not to debate those narratives nor change our own\, but 
 simply to hear and engage with them.  \n  \nIn this session\, we will focu
 s on narratives of the early Zionist movement and Jewish immigration\, up 
 to and including the Balfour Declaration and its impact (1880s - 1920).  
  \n  \nAdvance reading\, approximately two book chapters\, is required. Pl
 ease register so that Rabbi Justus can share pre-reading materials with yo
 u before the class.     \n  \n**Registration**: https://shomrei.easyshu
 l.com/events/6ac90befe0b01c00261147e5  \n  \nParticipants should expect th
 e learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psychological
 ly.  \n  \nThis session is open to all\, whether you attended Part I of th
 e series or not.   \n  \nThe first session\, on May 17\, covered the est
 ablishment of the State of Israel\, what Palestinians call the Naqba. The 
 third and final session\, scheduled for January 10\, will explore the Firs
 t Intifada.  \n  \nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the buildin
 g.  \n  \n**Questions?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.o
 rg  \n(973) 746-5031\n\n
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\, 
 USA\, Social Hall
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
