 me back MetroWest Shlicha (emissary) Daniella Gefen for an insightful disc
 ussion on the upcoming Israeli elections. Daniella will break down the con
 tentious issues driving Israelis to the polls and clarify the complex proc
 ess of forming a coalition government.  \n  \nDrawing from her background 
 as an educator\, community activist\, and clinical social worker\, Daniell
 a will deliver an engaging and accessible presentation you won't want to m
 iss.  \n  \nSponsored by the Shomrei Israel Committee and Jewish Federatio
 n of Greater Metrowest  \n  \n**------------------------------**  \n  \n**
 Cost:** Free or Suggested Donation of $18 per person (to help cover event
  costs).  \n  \n**Open to:** Shomrei Community and their Invited Friends 
