SUMMARY:Midday Meetup - Piano Concert with Clint Edwards
DESCRIPTION:**Midday MeetUp - Piano Concert with Clint Edwards**   \n  \n
 A monthly gathering to make connections and learn together.  \n12:30pm Cat
 ered Lunch (free)  \n1:15pm  Featured Program   \n  \n**Cost:** FREE or
  Suggested Donation of $10 per person to offset costs. (Bill My Account is
  only open to Shomrei Members)  \n  \n**RSVP:**  Required so we know how 
 much food to buy.  \nhttps://shomrei.easyshul.com/events/6ab6a9eb1d6f8f002
 72d4371  \n  \nWe are pleased to welcome back pianist\, composer\, and mus
 ic lecturer\, Clint Edwards. Clint will perform pop songs\, light classic
 al\, jazz and Broadway tunes while providing commentary and historical in
 sights. Please come and enjoy lunch followed by a piano performance for o
 ur first Midday Meetup of the season.   \n  \n**About Clint Edwards**  \n
 Clint Edwards is a composer\, arranger\, and pianist. His compositions and
  arrangements have been performed around the world. He is the winner of th
 e 2019 Broadway World Award for Best Independent Album Release. As a piani
 st\, he regularly gives more than 350 performances a year in the NYC metro
 politan area. For more information please visit: https://calendar.google.c
 om/calendar/u/0/www.ClintEdwardsMusic.com  \n  \n**\\***Members &amp\; Pre
 School Families should use their fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Mark
  your calendar for** these additional_dates_for_Midday_MeetUp: https://sh
 omrei.org/calendar/midday-meetup-calendar  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Of
 fice   \noffice@shomrei.org   \n  \n\\#middaymeetup\n\n
