DESCRIPTION:  \nTalk\, Teach\, Empower: Strategies for Addressing Antisemit
 ism with Children   \n\nHow can we instill Jewish joy and pride in our ch
 ildren\, while supporting them and ourselves\, as antisemitism increasingl
 y surfaces in our local schools and neighborhoods?\n\nJoin fellow parents/
 guardians of young children (ages 5-12) to learn with Rabbi Diana Fersko\,
  nationally recognized author of **We Need to Talk About Antisemitism**\, 
 for this practical workshop covering how to show up as a parent raising Je
 wish children in a world of antisemitism: focusing on safety\, Jewish prid
 e\, questions\, awareness and more.\n\nThis workshop is intended for paren
 ts/guardians of all backgrounds\, including interfaith\\* families.\n\n  \
 n**Open to:**  \nEveryone\, Visitors and Guests Welcome  \n  \n**RSVP Requ
 ired**  \n  \nAdd for events at Shomrei - **Members should bring their fo
 bs to enter the building.**   \n  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact the Shomre
