SUMMARY:Midday Meetup - Estate Planning
DESCRIPTION:**Midday MeetUp**   \nA monthly gathering to make connections 
 and learn together.  \n12:30pm Catered Lunch (free)  \n1:15pm  Featured P
 rogram   \n  \n**Topic** - Estate Planning: Four documents. Two tax syst
 ems. One integrated plan.  \n**Presenter** - Linda F. Spiegel\, Esq   \n
   \n**Cost:** FREE or Suggested Donation of $10 per person to offset cost
 s. (Bill My Account is only open to Shomrei Members)  \n  \n**RSVP:** Req
 uired so we know how much food to buy.  \nhttps://shomrei.easyshul.com/eve
 nts/6ad0ffd03e7684002567f097  \n  \n**\\***Members should use their fob to
  access the building.  \n  \n**About the Program**  \nJoin Linda F. Spiege
 l for an overview of four essential estate planning documents: three that 
 protect your wishes during your lifetime and one that guides the distribut
 ion of your estate after death. Learn how New Jersey’s inheritance tax a
 nd the federal estate tax fit into one integrated plan for your future.  \
 n  \n**About the Speaker**  \nLinda F. Spiegel\, Esq.is an Elder Care Plan
 ning mediator and works with families to help them with issues arising fro
 m aging relatives. When she is not mediating or arbitrating Ms. Spiegel wo
 rks with individuals\, couples and families in estate planning. She is als
 o a divorce mediator assisting couples to reach an amicable resolution of 
 their issues.  \n  \nMs. Spiegel graduated from Barnard College\, Columbia
  University and the Boston University School of Law. She is the Chair of t
 he American Bar Association’s Senior Lawyers Division Alternate Dispute 
 Resolution (ADR) Committee. In January. she was inducted into the National
  Academy of Distinguished Neutrals and is a recipient of a Joint Resolutio
 n of the Senate and General Assembly of the State of New Jersey for her wo
 rk as a volunteer attorney with Project SARAH\, Stop Abusive Relationships
  at Home.  \n  \nAdditional_Dates_for_for_Midday_MeetUps: https://shomrei.
 org/calendar/midday-meetup-calendar  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Office 
   \noffice@shomrei.org   \n  \n\\#middaymeetup\n\n
